---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Contacto | Calileus" description="Contacto y perfiles profesionales de Calileus." lang="es">
  <section class="section-band section-intro border-t-0">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contacto</p>
    <h1>Conectemos para arquitectura y liderazgo técnico.</h1>
    <p>Si estás contratando o colaborando en C++ moderno, sistemas safety-critical o delivery guiado por calidad, aquí están mis canales.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-band">
    <div class="grid-2">
      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Perfiles profesionales</h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-neutral-300">
          <li><a class="text-emerald-300 hover:underline" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/calileus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-emerald-300 hover:underline" href="https://github.com/Calileus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-emerald-300 hover:underline" href="https://www.hackerrank.com/profile/calileus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HackerRank</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Organizaciones y comunidad</h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-neutral-300">
          <li><a class="text-emerald-300 hover:underline" href="https://github.com/ObsidianHonorCoders" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ObsidianHonorCoders</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-emerald-300 hover:underline" href="https://github.com/CalileusLab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CalileusLab</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-emerald-300 hover:underline" href="https://olimpiada-logica.webnode.mx/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Olimpiada Mexicana de Lógica</a></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
